        "entry_type": "decision",
        "text": "**Header Isolation \u0026 Private Member Access**: `BLEManager.cpp` and all public headers remain completely free of `\u003cNimBLE*.h\u003e` includes (D6). In `esp-nimble-cpp` v2, `NimBLEServer::m_svcVec` is private without a public vector getter; rather than hacking headers or leaking stack abstractions, standard C++ template friend instantiation (`template struct Rob\u003c...\u003e`) was used in `BLEStack.cpp` to safely access `m_svcVec` at zero runtime cost."
      }
    },
