        "entry_type": "decision",
        "text": "**Application Decoupling**: Avoided including `modules/Application/Application.hpp` inside `BLEManager.cpp` to prevent circular LDF dependency chains pulling `MCPServer` into native test runs. Declared only the minimal non-virtual interface needed (`getState()` and `getEventBus()`)."
