        "entry_type": "ruled-out",
        "text": "**`NimBLEServer::getServices()`**: In `esp-nimble-cpp` v2, `NimBLEClient` has `getServices()` but `NimBLEServer` does not. Attempting to call `_server-\u003egetServices()` fails compilation. Use `getServerServices(_server)` via `Rob` accessor in `BLEStack.cpp`."
      }
