        "text": "**`ble_svc_gap_ppcp_set()`**: GAP PPCP is not set via a runtime C API function in NimBLE ESP-IDF; it is configured via Mynewt syscfg and advertising parameters (`pAdv-\u003esetPreferredParams()`)."
