        "entry_type": "ruled-out",
        "text": "**`library.json` Dependency on Application**: Adding `\"Application\": \"*\"` to `BLEManager/library.json` causes PlatformIO's LDF in native test environments to transitively pull `MCPServer`, which fails on native without `WifiManager.hpp`. `BLEManager` must not declare `Application` in `library.json`."
